				<wikidot:authorName>Lt Flops</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1735419</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <blockquote> <p><strong>Solidão</strong><br /> <strong>Author:</strong> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lt-flops" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1735419&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1601843090" alt="Lt Flops" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1735419)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lt-flops" >Lt Flops</a></span></p> </blockquote> <hr /> <p>The journal entries seen here used to be a part of an article I posted in 2017. I have long-since self-deleted it, though you can see an archived version of that article here: <strong><a href="http://scpdsandbox.wikidot.com/floppy-archive-1" target="_blank">URA-2641</a></strong>. I think this version works a lot better. Here is an excerpt of the original author post from that 2017 article:</p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▷&nbsp;Snip</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <blockquote> <p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><tt>25 Apr 2017, 01:53</tt></span><br /> Hello everybody, this is my first skip!</p> <p>I've been working on this ever since the start of the 3000 contest (though it's not related to that contest by any means, I will admit the contest was a huge inspiration for my skip). I'd like to thank the following users for providing me with feedback over various iterations of this skip. <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/voct" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=392303&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1601843090" alt="Voct" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=392303)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/voct" >Voct</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/thetataurus" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2768920&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1601843090" alt="Thetataurus" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2768920)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/thetataurus" >Thetataurus</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/thewalkindude" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2902115&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1601843090" alt="thewalkindude" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2902115)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/thewalkindude" >thewalkindude</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mrwrong" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2039383&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1601843090" alt="MrWrong" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2039383)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mrwrong" >MrWrong</a></span>, OrdinaryAnomaly, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/aurox" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3071093&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1601843090" alt="Aurox" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3071093)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/aurox" >Aurox</a></span>, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mranakinspecter" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1477805&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1601843090" alt="MrAnakinSpecter" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1477805)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mranakinspecter" >MrAnakinSpecter</a></span>. As well, thanks to saezi on Reddit for further feedback, and to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/communism-will-win" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=617958&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1601843090" alt="Communism will win" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=617958)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/communism-will-win" >Communism will win</a></span> for test log inspiration. Further thanks to anyone in #site19 that took part in brainstorming.</p> </blockquote> </div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">△&nbsp;Close</a></div> </div> </div> <p>Currently, this is a standalone piece.</p> <p>Special thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tsatpwtcotttadc" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3681296&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1601843090" alt="TSATPWTCOTTTADC" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3681296)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tsatpwtcotttadc" >TSATPWTCOTTTADC</a></span> for providing some much-needed final feedback.</p> <hr /> <p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size:110%;"><strong>Image Attribution</strong></span></p> <blockquote> <p><strong>Filename:</strong> javari-valley-maloca.png<br /> <strong>Name:</strong> Índios isolados do Acre<br /> <strong>Author:</strong> <a href="https://www.flickr.com/photos/fotosdoacre/">Agência de Notícias do Acre</a> (Gleilson Miranda / Governo do Acre)<br /> <strong>License:</strong> CC BY 2.0<br /> <strong>Source Link:</strong> <a href="https://flic.kr/p/6MbRMH">Flickr</a><br /> <strong>Note:</strong> Edited by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lt-flops" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1735419&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1601843090" alt="Lt Flops" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1735419)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lt-flops" >Lt Flops</a></span></p> </blockquote> <hr /> <p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size:130%;"><strong><a target="_blank" href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/floppyphoenix">If you liked this, check out my Author Page!</a></strong></span></p> 
